{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesBox\/documentation\/EnsemblesBox\/BoxCloudFileSystem","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BoxCloudFileSystem","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BoxCloudFileSystem","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"class","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:12EnsemblesBox0B15CloudFileSystemC","modules":[{"name":"EnsemblesBox"}],"roleHeading":"Class","title":"BoxCloudFileSystem"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BoxCloudFileSystem","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This backend requires the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/box\/box-ios-sdk.git","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"package. With the source distribution, enable the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Box","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" package trait and SPM resolves it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"automatically. With the binary distribution (XCFrameworks), add BoxSDK as a separate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"package dependency in your project."}]}],"type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Box uses numeric IDs rather than paths to identify files and folders. This backend","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bridges the path-based ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CloudFileSystem"},{"text":" protocol onto Box’s ID-based API by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"walking the folder hierarchy to resolve Ensembles paths","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ensembleId\/events\/file.json"},{"text":") to Box folder and file IDs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Resolved IDs are cached in internal dictionaries to minimize API calls. The cache","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is invalidated when items are deleted or when not-found errors indicate stale entries.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The app creates and configures a ","type":"text"},{"code":"BoxClient","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with its own authentication","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and injects it at init time:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let auth = BoxDeveloperTokenAuth(token: \"your-token\")","let client = BoxClient(auth: auth)","let cloudFS = BoxCloudFileSystem(client: client)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"heading","text":"Authentication","anchor":"Authentication","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Box Swift SDK supports multiple authentication methods. Create a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"BoxClient","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with the appropriate auth for your use case:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Developer Token (testing only)","anchor":"Developer-Token-testing-only","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get a short-lived token from "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/developer.box.com\/","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"under your app’s configuration page. These tokens expire after 60 minutes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let auth = BoxDeveloperTokenAuth(token: \"your-developer-token\")","let client = BoxClient(auth: auth)","let cloudFS = BoxCloudFileSystem(client: client)"]},{"anchor":"OAuth-20-production-apps","text":"OAuth 2.0 (production apps)","typ